Untrapping the arrow traps in the Mines will generally give
enough arrows that you can afford to loose some.  Most of the
time, as a Samurai, you will be meleeing.  (I'd keep the
original ya until I could bless them, and my luck was max'ed
out, and just use the plain arrows earlier.)

> My skill slot order goes something like dagger to basic by the
