> weapon to skilled by the end of the mines, bow to expert as
> soon as my luck is maxed out from an altar, then whatever else
> comes to mind later.  An XP=3D30 Samurai I am running in vanilla
> is expert at bow, long sword, two weapon, martial arts, skilled
> at broadsword and polearm, basic at dagger, saber, pickaxe
> and shuriken.  Foocubi dancing rules.

Depending on where I've got my magic resistence and reflection,
I might try for a robe and some spells.  An XP=3D30 Samurai can
cast cone of cold or fire at 0% failure, and touch of death with
only about 15% failure.  It's a nice alternative to the bow when
there's water around.

